; VGPU98 8x14 font, code page 437. Original design for this project.
; Used by 350-line text modes and modes 0Fh and 10h. Format: spec/font-format.md.
;
; Derived from the 8x16 design by dropping its top and bottom rows, so the two
; sizes share one source. The 8x16 design keeps those rows blank except in
; cell-spanning glyphs, and fontc stops if deriving would cut pixels off any
; other glyph. A glyph that needs a different shape at 14 rows is drawn again
; below the derive line.

font 8x14
derive vga8x16.fnt drop-rows 0 15
lines 6 5 7 3 2 4
